msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can activate the :doc:`developer mode <../../../general/"
"developer_mode>` on the **product's template**, and under "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, change or create the ribbon from "
"the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field."
