#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/products/price_management.rst:57
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a :doc:`price per unit <../../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/product_management/configure/uom>` on the product page. To do "
"that, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"enable :guilabel:`Product Reference Price` under the :guilabel:`Shop - "
"Products` section. When enabled, ensure an amount is set in "
"the :guilabel:`Base Unit Count` field of the **product template**, and in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/products/price_management.rst:None
