"Under the :guilabel:`If incoming requests match...` section, "
"select :guilabel:`Custom filter expression` and use the following "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""
"В разделе :guilabel:`If incoming requests match...` "
"выберите :guilabel:`Custom filter expression` и используйте следующую "
"конфигурацию:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:295
